Core/Jessie: The trees out here are massive. How’d they grow so fast?
Core/Rose: The Bloom doesn’t just infect people. It accelerates all plant growth in the area.
Core/Jessie: So the infection is terraforming the city.
Core/Rose: Essentially, yes. Converting urban environments into ecosystems that support the infected.
Core/Jessie: That’s… really creepy when you say it like that.
Core/Rose: It’s adaptive. And that’s what makes it so dangerous.